      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "stage-button",
      "description": "外观预览；实际页面由motion.mjs维护aria-pressed与手动模式。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-track\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"演示步骤\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">入库</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">库存</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">财务</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">追溯</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-track{display:inline-flex;gap:2px;padding:4px;border-radius:26px;border:1px solid #c8d9de;background:#edf3f6;box-shadow:inset 0 1px #fff,0 3px 8px #395d6a08}.ds-track button{font:12px Inter,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;line-height:1.4;padding:8px 16px;border:0;border-radius:22px;background:transparent;color:#47616d;cursor:pointer}.ds-track button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#078579;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 3px 8px #087f7520}.ds-track button:hover{background:#d3eee8;color:#076c60}.ds-track button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--teal,#176f67);outline-offset:5px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "单据面板",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "receipt-sheet",
      "description": "逻辑画布中的白底单据区域；紧凑与初始镜头在页面中有局部padding覆盖。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-sheet\"><div class=\"ds-sheet-title\"><h3>单据信息</h3><strong>DEMO-001<i class=\"ds-anchor\"></i></strong></div><p>供应商 A · 主仓库</p><div class=\"ds-total\">合计 <strong>¥120.00</strong></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-sheet{font:16px Inter,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;padding:23px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dde7ee;border-radius:8px;color:#203440}.ds-sheet-title{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-bottom:22px}.ds-sheet-title h3{font-size:17px;margin:0}.ds-sheet-title strong{font-size:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:#20685e}.ds-anchor{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#12bfa7;box-shadow:0 0 0 5px #d4f6ee}.ds-total{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;color:#647985;margin-top:18px}.ds-total strong{font-size:23px;color:#193d49;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
    },
    {
      "name": "银白实体窗的CSS外观",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "demo-window",
      "description": "当前银边、标题栏和窗底的自包含静态外观；完整桌面厚度、地面光影与来源带由WebGL实现，此预览不初始化GPU。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-window\"><div class=\"ds-viewport\"><div class=\"ds-chrome\"><span class=\"ds-lights\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>Nexora ERP</span><span class=\"ds-demo\">交互演示</span></div><div class=\"ds-window-body\"><h2>采购入库</h2><p>DEMO-001 · 库存 +12 · 应付 ¥120.00</p></div><div class=\"ds-base\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-window{font-family:Inter,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;position:relative;border-radius:14px;transform-origin:50% 100%;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#8e9da8,#fff 2%,#c7d2d9 3%,#fafdff 5%,#fff 96%,#9dafbb);box-shadow:0 2px 3px #3d566459,0 18px 28px #29434f20}.ds-viewport{padding:3px;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#8396a5,#fff 1%,#becdd5 2%,#fff 3%,#e8f0f6 97%,#b0bec8)}.ds-chrome{height:40px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:0 16px;background:linear-gradient(#fbfdff,#eaf0f5);border-radius:11px 11px 0 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d6e2e9;font-size:13px;color:#354955}.ds-lights{display:flex;gap:7px;margin-right:8px}.ds-lights i{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;background:#ff655b;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #00000012}.ds-lights i:nth-child(2){background:#f5bf4f}.ds-lights i:nth-child(3){background:#48c775}.ds-demo{margin-left:auto;color:#536675}.ds-window-body{padding:28px 30px 24px;background:#fbfdff;color:#203440;border-radius:0 0 10px 10px;font-size:16px}.ds-window-body h2{font-size:36px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 24px}.ds-base{height:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#758994,#fff 15%,#d1dbe1 85%,#849aa8);border-radius:0 0 12px 12px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "应用侧栏",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "桌面保留六项文字；采购、库存、财务是聚焦按钮，销售、生产、系统是不可点击的上下文标签。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-sidebar\" aria-label=\"演示导航\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-selected\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3h2l2 12h11l3-9H6M9 20h.01M18 20h.01\"/></svg><span>采购</span></button><button type=\"button\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 9 5v9l-9 5-9-5V8l9-5Zm0 9 9-4M12 12 3 8m9 4v10M7 6l10 5\"/></svg><span>库存</span></button><span class=\"ds-context\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10V5l8-3 8 3v5M4 10l8-3 8 3v11H4V10Zm5 11v-7h6v7\"/></svg><span>销售</span></span><span class=\"ds-context\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 21V9l6 3V6l6 6V9l6 3v9H3Zm3-5h2m3 0h2m3 0h2M15 4V2h3v6\"/></svg><span>生产</span></span><button type=\"button\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"3\" width=\"14\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M15 8h-4a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 0 4H9m3-10v12\"/></svg><span>财务</span></button><span class=\"ds-bottom\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 3 1-2h4l1 2 3 2 2 1v4l-2 1v4l2 1v4l-2 1-3 2-1 2h-4l-1-2-3-2-2-1v-4l2-1v-4L4 10V6l2-1 3-2Z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg><span>系统</span></span></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-sidebar{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;width:148px;min-height:410px;padding:24px 12px 18px;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#eef5f9,#f7fafc);border-right:1px solid #dce7ed;font-family:Inter,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}.ds-sidebar button,.ds-context,.ds-bottom{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px 10px;border:0;background:transparent;border-radius:6px;color:#4c6472;font-size:17px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap}.ds-sidebar svg{flex-shrink:0}.ds-sidebar .ds-selected{color:#086e66;background:#ccf3ed}.ds-sidebar button:hover{background:#dcefe9;color:#086e66}.ds-sidebar button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--teal,#176f67);outline-offset:5px}.ds-bottom{margin-top:auto;padding-top:24px}"
